{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Set up a cross-sector framework to deliver national food and farming education",
        "additional_details": "We believe our country needs a joined-up approach to food, farming and education. By using its work in response to the Curriculum and Assessment Review to establish a mandatory cross-sector framework, Government should connect schools, farmers and food supply chains, remove barriers to participation, build future workforce pipelines, strengthen food security and enable industry's existing investment in farming to deliver measurable public value through education.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to use its work in response to the 2025 Curriculum and Assessment Review to establish a cross-sector delivery framework that links commercial food supply chains to the classroom & strengthens workforce pipelines for Critical National Infrastructure.",
